.TH KNOTS-TEST-COMPLEXITY 1 "2026-08-26" "knots 1.16.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
knots-test-complexity \- test quality analyzer for C/C++/Rust/Python/JavaScript unit tests
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B knots-test-complexity
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] <\fITEST_FILE\fR> <\fISOURCE_FILE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B knots-test-complexity
validates that unit tests have sufficient complexity and boundary coverage
relative to the source code they test.
It compares the complexity of test functions against source functions and
checks for boundary value testing patterns.
.PP
This tool is designed for use in CI/CD pipelines and pre-commit hooks to
enforce test quality standards.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \fB\-\-threshold\fR " " \fIVALUE\fR
Minimum test-to-source complexity ratio.
Default: 0.70 (70%).
Must be between 0.0 and 2.0.
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \fB\-\-boundary\-threshold\fR " " \fIVALUE\fR
Minimum boundary test coverage ratio.
Default: 0.80 (80%).
Must be between 0.0 and 1.0.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \fB\-\-level\fR " " \fILEVEL\fR
Enforcement level.
Valid values are \fBwarn\fR (print warnings but exit 0) and \fBerror\fR
(exit 1 on failure).
Default: warn.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-check\-boundaries
Disable boundary value checking.
By default, boundary checking is enabled.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Show detailed per-function analysis.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help message.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version information.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Tests meet quality thresholds, or enforcement level is set to \fBwarn\fR.
.TP
.B 1
Tests do not meet quality thresholds and enforcement level is \fBerror\fR,
or an error occurred (file not found, invalid arguments).
.SH EXAMPLES
Check test quality with default thresholds:
.RS
.nf
knots-test-complexity test/test_module.c src/module.c
.fi
.RE
.PP
Strict mode with custom thresholds:
.RS
.nf
knots-test-complexity \-t 0.90 \-b 0.90 \-l error test/test_module.c src/module.c
.fi
.RE
.PP
Skip boundary checking:
.RS
.nf
knots-test-complexity \-\-no\-check\-boundaries test/test_module.c src/module.c
.fi
.RE
.PP
Verbose output:
.RS
.nf
knots-test-complexity \-v test/test_module.c src/module.c
.fi
.RE
